From c69908b1cbafae204c9d901e18781b85193286e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 03:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix profile send-message ignoring message request v2 routes

Profile and messaging entry points still relied on requiresMessageRequest,
which the v2 direct-message router never sets. Outgoing request routes were
written to presentationRoute instead, so tapping send message often did
nothing.

Add consumeProfileMessagePresentation to resolve conversation or pending chat
from the completion value or presentationRoute, surface routing errors on
profiles, and apply the same handling in feed preview and new conversation
search.
